  "notes": "Modified cash basis village. Governmental lines from the governmental funds statement Total Governmental Funds 2024 column (p6). Taxes 109,519 split by the Schedule 2 Totals column (p11) into property, motor vehicle and sales tax; Intergovernmental revenues 68,101 split by the same column. Bond principal/interest payments printed under other financing sources (uses), recorded as disbursements outside the printed total. Business-type from the proprietary funds statement (p8), net position measure; receipts total = operating 69,454 + interest 276. Balance sheet from the government-wide Statement of Net Position (capital assets and debt present). Detail: Schedule 2 (major funds) and Schedule 4 (nonmajor) per fund; Schedule 5 combined budget (fund-level totals only) not recorded to avoid double counting; Schedule 6 proprietary combined lines recorded (actual column). Debt Service fund had no activity. Read pages 1-14 of 14"
